SUMMARY:LEGO Animation 3 (Grades 1-3)
DESCRIPTION:This camp is SOLD OUT. Join the waitlist here. Build sets and characters with LEGOs\, then create a short stop-motion movie using iPads. Work in groups to add special effects\, dialogue\, and music! Instructor: Mike Marquez
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/lego-animation-3-grades-1-3-4/
CATEGORIES:Classes & Camps
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Charles M. Schulz Museum
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260803T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260807T123000
DTSTAMP:20260717T225759Z
CREATED:20260218T183325Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260717T225759Z
UID:10003026-1785747600-1786105800@schulzmuseum.org
SUMMARY:Let's Make Comics (Grades 4–6)
DESCRIPTION:Get your pencils ready for a week of cartooning\, comics\, crafts\, and animation! Design characters\, develop story ideas\, sketch live ice skaters at Snoopy’s Home Ice\, and craft your own paper toys. Create individual and collaborative comics that bring your ideas to life! Instructor: Angelica Blancas-Mims
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/lets-make-comics-grades-4-6-2/
CATEGORIES:Classes & Camps
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Charles M. Schulz Museum
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260803T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260807T163000
DTSTAMP:20260218T182742Z
CREATED:20260218T182742Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260218T182742Z
UID:10002765-1785762000-1786120200@schulzmuseum.org
SUMMARY:Snoopy Safari Mini (Grades TK-K)
DESCRIPTION:Take a creative adventure through Snoopy’s many personas and learn about the animals he impersonates and their habitats. Make your own safari gear and explore sharks\, penguins\, polar bears\, snakes\, and more through drawing\, painting\, clay\, and collage. Children must be at least 4 years old to register.
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/snoopy-safari-mini-grades-tk-k/
CATEGORIES:Classes & Camps
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Charles M. Schulz Museum
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260803T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260807T163000
DTSTAMP:20260601T212755Z
CREATED:20260218T182817Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260601T212755Z
UID:10002766-1785762000-1786120200@schulzmuseum.org
SUMMARY:Shape Shifters Sculpture Camp (Grades 1-6)
DESCRIPTION:This camp is SOLD OUT. Join the waitlist here. Explore and create 3D art with clay\, found objects\, re-purposed materials\, and more. Mold and paint clay creatures\, engineer and build clay towers\, create a classroom cardboard city\, and design edible structures\, too! Instructor:  Mike Marquez
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/shape-shifters-sculpture-camp-grades-1-6-2/
CATEGORIES:Classes & Camps
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Charles M. Schulz Museum
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260808T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260808T150000
DTSTAMP:20260731T184252Z
CREATED:20260325T205150Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260731T184252Z
UID:10003054-1786186800-1786201200@schulzmuseum.org
SUMMARY:Happy Anniversary\, Schulz Museum!
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the Museum’s anniversary and make yourself at home in our home of 24 years! Watch the new Peanuts animated special\, Snoopy Presents: There’s No Place Like Home\, Snoopy (Apple TV)\, on the big screen\, meet pets available for adoption\, sculpt a mini Snoopy charm\, and get hugs with Snoopy!
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/happy-anniversary-schulz-museum-2/
CATEGORIES:Calendar of Events
END:VEVENT
