SUMMARY:Summer Science Mini Day Camp Monday (Grades TK-K)
DESCRIPTION:Monday\, August 10 is SOLD OUT. Join the waitlist here. Explore all things summer! On Monday\, dig up the dirt on bugs. Make a bug house\, mold itsy bitsy clay spiders\, and search for bugs all around the Museum! Bring a lunch and stay all day. This is a single-day camp for Monday\, August 10\, from 9:00 am–4:30 pm\, only. Select the other Summer Science Mini Day Camps to create your custom schedule! Children must be at least 4 years old to register.
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/summer-science-mini-day-camp-monday-grades-tk-k/
CATEGORIES:Classes & Camps
END:VEVENT
