SUMMARY:Camp Freeze Day Camp Tuesday (Grades 1-6)
DESCRIPTION:Tuesday\, August 11 is SOLD OUT. Join the waitlist here. Chill out this summer with the coolest camp yet! Select the number of days you need to make your custom schedule of hands-on winter-themed projects\, games\, and experiments. There is no ice skating on Tuesday. Campers will explore the Schulz complex and get a behind-the-scenes peek at Snoopy’s Home Ice instead! Bring a lunch and stay all day. This is a single-day camp for Tuesday\, August 11\, from 9:00 am–4:30 pm\, only. Instructor: Mike Marquez
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/camp-freeze-day-camp-tuesday-grades-1-6/
