SUMMARY:Summer Science Mini Day Camp Tuesday (Grades TK-K)
DESCRIPTION:Tuesday\, August 11 is SOLD OUT. Join the waitlist here. Explore all things summer! On Tuesday\, dive into the science of water. Sculpt a river for sailboats\, mix super sand slime\, build LEGO dams\, and get wet with outside water play! Bring a lunch and stay all day. This is a single-day camp for Tuesday\, August 11\, from 9:00 am–4:30 pm\, only. Select the other Summer Science Mini Day Camps to create your custom schedule! Children must be at least 4 years old to register.
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/summer-science-mini-day-camp-tuesday-grades-tk-k/
CATEGORIES:Classes & Camps
