SUMMARY:Summer Science Mini Day Camp Thursday (Grades TK-K)
DESCRIPTION:Thursday\, August 13 is SOLD OUT. Explore all things summer! On Thursday\, look to the stars to explore the summer sky. Make art with the sun\, paint a planet\, and take a space walk all around the Schulz campus. Bring a lunch and stay all day. This is a single-day camp for Thursday\, August 13\, from 9:00 am–4:30 pm\, only. Select the other Summer Science Mini Day Camps to create your custom schedule! Children must be at least 4 years old to register.
