SUMMARY:Summer Science Mini Day Camp Friday (Grades TK-K)
DESCRIPTION:Friday\, August 14 is SOLD OUT. Join the waitlist here. Explore all things summer! On Friday\, keep cool with a behind-the-scenes visit to Snoopy’s Home Ice. Also\, make ice cream in a bag\, mix a snowstorm in a jar\, paint with ice cubes\, and enjoy popcorn and a short Peanuts movie in the Museum theater. Bring a lunch and stay all day. This is a single-day camp for Friday\, August 14\, from 9:00 am–4:30 pm\, only. Select the other Summer Science Mini Day Camps to create your custom schedule! Children must be at least 4 years old to register.
