SUMMARY:Sip and Sketch Happy Hour
DESCRIPTION:Ages 21+ are invited to enjoy serious\, silly\, and seriously silly drawing challenges with Joe Wos\, the Emmy Award-winning host of Cartoon Academy\, while sipping suds from Cuver Brewery and snacking on pasta salad from Banza.
