SUMMARY:Museum Mondays for Little Ones: Blast Off!
DESCRIPTION:On the last Monday of the month\, enjoy stories\, crafts\, and activities designed for children ages 1-5 and their caregivers. This month\, launch into hands-on exploration with space-themed crafts. Make an edible constellation\, decorate an astronaut helmet\, and paint sparkling stars in a watercolor galaxy.  
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/museum-mondays-for-little-ones-blast-off/
